  Bringing up your sandbox
  The first time takes a few minutes. Quitting stops the step that runs. What
  is done stays, and u runs the steps again.

  ✓ Start the tunnel                                                       10s
  ✓ Create or check the cluster                                            10s
  ✓ Start the issuer mirror                                                10s
  ✓ Verify the issuer with Keycard                                         10s
  ✓ Import the images                                                      10s
  ✓ Set up the Keycard zone                                                10s
